	.string "I make costumes for POKéMON.\nRight now I'm sewing for a very\pspecial client…\pA GYM LEADER, maybe? Come back\nwhen you are one!$"

EventMons_Text_CostumeIntro::
	.string "Oh! You're a GYM LEADER now?\nThen you need a star for your\pshows!\pThis PIKACHU loves dressing up\nmore than anything. Its costumes\pare my life's work. Please, take\nit!$"

EventMons_Text_CostumeExplain::
	.string "I have five costumes for it, but\neach one has to suit you first.\pROCK STAR is cool: win 7 in a\nrow in the ACADEMY's BATTLE\pHALL.\pBELLE is beautiful: decorate\nyour GYM with 20 pieces or more.\pPOP STAR is cute: win the\nCONVENTION's FAIRY hall.\pPH.D. is smart: hear every\nlecture at the ACADEMY.\pLIBRE is tough: win the\nCONVENTION's FIGHTING hall.\pCome back any time and I'll\ndress it up!$"

