EventMons_Text_CapBoyIntro::
	.string "Did you know a TRAINER from\nPALLET TOWN once went to every\pregion in the world?\pI collected a cap from each one,\njust like his! Then I took them\pon a trip around KANTO…\p…and lost every single one.\nSeven caps! Waaah!\pHey, you travel a lot, right? If\nyou find my caps, I'll trade you\psomething really special for\neach one!\pHere, put them in this!$"

EventMons_Text_CapBoyCase::
	.string "My CAP CASE! Look carefully.\nCaps get snagged in the\pstrangest places.$"

EventMons_Text_CapBoyThanks::
	.string "My {STR_VAR_1}! You found it!\pHere, this PIKACHU wears one\njust like it. A trade's a trade!$"

EventMons_Text_CapBoyAll::
	.string "All seven caps! My collection's\nback!\pYou're a real partner. This\nPIKACHU wears the PARTNER CAP.\pIt's the most special of all!$"

EventMons_Text_CapBoyHint::
	.string "{STR_VAR_3} caps are still out\nthere.\pI think I lost the {STR_VAR_1}\nsomewhere around {STR_VAR_2}…$"

EventMons_Text_CapBoyDone::
	.string "My caps are all back, thanks to\nyou! Take good care of those\pPIKACHU!$"

EventMons_Text_CapFound::
	.string "{PLAYER} found the {STR_VAR_1}!$"

EventMons_Text_CapInCase::
	.string "{PLAYER} put the {STR_VAR_1} in\nthe CAP CASE.$"

EventMons_Text_CapNoCase::
	.string "There's a little cap stuck here,\na PIKACHU's size. Someone must\phave lost it…$"

EventMons_Text_OakPikachuOffer::
	.string "OAK: Ah, {PLAYER}! A master of\nELECTRIC types now!\pA PIKACHU here at the lab has\nbeen watching you on TV. It's a\pstrong one, and very picky.\pIt will only go with a trainer\nwho really knows its type. Will\pyou take my quiz? Five\nquestions, all of them right!$"

EventMons_Text_OakEeveeOffer::
