EventMons_Text_GlimwoodBoy::
	.string "I live here in the forest. My\nDADA raised me, a ZARUDE with a\pcape made of vines.\pHe went away a long time ago…\nThey say the forest's guardian,\pCELEBI, saved him once.\pIf CELEBI came here, maybe DADA\nwould come back too, once the\pother ZARUDE are calm.$"

EventMons_Text_GlimwoodBoyAfter::
	.string "DADA's back! You and CELEBI\nfound him. Thank you!$"

EventMons_Text_Groundskeeper::
	.string "I keep the pitch. The old-timers\nstill talk about the DARKEST\pDAY, when ETERNATUS burst out of\nthe sky right here.\pThey say it only takes that\nshape on this pitch. And only if\pZACIAN and ZAMAZENTA stand with\nit, the way they did that day…$"

EventMons_Text_GroundskeeperAfter::
	.string "You tamed the DARKEST DAY\nitself!\pThat power belongs to this\npitch, though. Anywhere else,\pit's just ETERNATUS. Bring it\nback here to see it again.$"

EventMons_Text_VivillonIntro::
	.string "VIVILLON's wings have a\ndifferent pattern in every\pcorner of the world. I'm\nsketching every one!\pBring me VIVILLON with patterns\nI haven't seen. Show me 6, and\pI'll give you something rare.\nAll 18, and something rarer\pstill!\pSo far I've seen {STR_VAR_1}.$"

EventMons_Text_VivillonNew::
	.string "Ooh! {STR_VAR_2} new patterns!\nThat's {STR_VAR_1} in my\psketchbook now!$"

EventMons_Text_VivillonFancy::
	.string "Six patterns! As promised, a\nSCATTERBUG whose wings will\pbloom like a FANCY garden party!$"

EventMons_Text_VivillonPokeBall::
	.string "All 18! My sketchbook's\ncomplete! This SCATTERBUG's\pwings will look just like a POKé\nBALL!$"

EventMons_Text_VivillonWild::
	.string "Its kind's been seen fluttering\naround this zone too, now and\pthen. Keep an eye out!$"

EventMons_Text_BondNotYet::
	.string "There's a story of a GRENINJA\nwhose bond with its trainer let\pit take their shape in battle.\pI'm looking for a trainer like\nthat. Someone who could take on\pKALOS's best in that big\nunderground tournament, and win…$"

EventMons_Text_BondGive::
	.string "You beat KALOS's best in that\ntournament! I saw it all.\pThis FROAKIE was born on the\nbeach where that GRENINJA lived.\pRaise it, and bond with it!$"

EventMons_Text_BondAfter::
	.string "When your bond is strong enough,\nyour GRENINJA will show you\psomething amazing.$"

EventMons_Text_AzStranger::
	.string "A very tall man is staring out\nover the badlands. He doesn't\pseem to notice you.$"

EventMons_Text_AzIntro::
	.string "AZ: …You. I saw you in that\ntournament.\pI am looking for a flower. A\nFLOETTE. I lost her three\pthousand years ago.$"

EventMons_Text_AzStory::
	.string "AZ: That FLOETTE of yours… She\nlooks so much like mine.\pI was a king. When my FLOETTE\nwas taken by war, I built a\pmachine to bring her back, and\nthen I turned it on the world in\pmy grief.\pShe left me. She could not\nforgive what I had done. I have\pwalked ever since.\pThe legends of this land,\nXERNEAS, YVELTAL, ZYGARDE… If a\ptrainer were trusted by all\nthree, perhaps she would trust\pthem too.$"

EventMons_Text_AzTrio::
	.string "AZ: Life, destruction, and\norder… {STR_VAR_1} has not yet\panswered to you.$"

EventMons_Text_AzReturn::
	.string "AZ: …Do you hear that? Petals,\non the wind.\p…FLOETTE! You came back!\p…She does not come back to me.\nShe is choosing you. She was\palways wiser than her king.\pTake her. Let her see a world at\npeace.$"

EventMons_Text_AzAfter::
	.string "AZ: She has found someone worth\ntrusting. That is enough for me.$"

EventMons_Text_TalaIntro::
	.string "TALA: My ROCKRUFF had a pup that\nnever howls with the others. It\pdoes everything at its own pace.\pIt wants a trainer whose pack\ncan outrun mine. Want to try?$"

EventMons_Text_TalaWon::
	.string "TALA: Ha! Your pack's the real\ndeal. This little one's yours.\pIt'll never howl on cue, but\nit'll never quit, either!$"

EventMons_Text_TalaAfter::
	.string "TALA: Raise that pup well! It'll\ngrow into something no other\pLYCANROC can be.$"

EventMons_Text_TalaLater::
	.string "TALA: Whenever you're ready.$"

EventMons_Text_TalaLost::
	.string "TALA: Not fast enough! Come back\nwhen your pack's stronger.$"

EventMons_Text_ArtisanNotYet::
	.string "I restore antiques. My dream is\nto see a POKéMON that was built\pfive hundred years ago… a\nMAGEARNA.\pIf you ever meet one, come and\ntell me!$"

EventMons_Text_ArtisanPots::
	.string "A real MAGEARNA! The first one\nwas painted red and gold. I'd\plove to paint one just like it.\pBut I lost my four antique paint\npots somewhere in this zone…\p{STR_VAR_2} are still missing.$"

EventMons_Text_ArtisanPaint::
	.string "My paint pots! All four! Now,\njust like the first one…\pThere. The ORIGINAL COLOR, five\nhundred years later. It's yours.\pTreasure it!$"

EventMons_Text_ArtisanAfter::
	.string "Red and gold, just like the old\ndrawings. It's the best work\pI've ever done.$"

EventMons_Text_PotFound::
	.string "{PLAYER} found an antique paint\npot!$"

EventMons_Text_PotsLeft::
	.string "{STR_VAR_2} more to find.$"

EventMons_Text_PotsAll::
	.string "That's all four! Time to take\nthem back to the artisan.$"

